%p Illinois Data Bank lets you upload files but not entire folders.
%p
  If your data is organized in folders and you want to preserve that structure, zip or tar files before uploading.
%p
  See our Data Nudge on
  %a{href: "https://go.illinois.edu/2018-08", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener"} Common zipped file formats used in research
  for tips.
